---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects" description="Research projects — Baixin Guo">
  <div class="container-content py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="section-label mb-4">Projects</span>
      <h1 class="mb-4">One flagship, bounded supporting work</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-10 max-w-2xl">
        InteractionKit is the active research direction. The remaining projects document formative evidence, infrastructure, or failed and frozen prototypes; they are not presented as parallel validated contributions.
      </p>

      <section class="card mb-10 border-l-4 border-l-[var(--color-primary)]">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="badge badge-primary">Flagship</span>
          <span class="badge badge-gold">v1.0.0 · Public release</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-[0.6rem] text-[var(--color-muted)] uppercase tracking-wider">Software verified · human evidence pending</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-3">InteractionKit</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] leading-relaxed mb-5">
          Typed experiment infrastructure for testing whether corrective interfaces must match how AI communication fails. The active Study 2 direction crosses two communication failures with two truthful corrective cards and treats matched versus mismatched correction as the key causal contrast.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-5">
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center"><div class="stat-number text-xl">3</div><div class="stat-label">typed primitives</div></div>
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center"><div class="stat-number text-xl">7</div><div class="stat-label">contract tests</div></div>
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center"><div class="stat-number text-xl">24</div><div class="stat-label">planned scenarios</div></div>
          <div class="bg-[var(--color-page-alt)] rounded-lg p-3 text-center"><div class="stat-number text-xl">0</div><div class="stat-label">participants claimed</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/research/building-trustworthy-ai/interactionkit/research-brief/" class="btn btn-primary">10-minute research brief</a>
          <a href="/research/building-trustworthy-ai/interactionkit/" class="btn">Artifact details</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/GBX-Max1220/InteractionKit" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">GitHub →</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <span class="section-label">Supporting evidence</span>
        <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-[var(--color-rule-light)]"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="badge badge-gold">Formative intervention</span></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg mb-2">CheckMyCoach</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-4">A fixed 40-case offline evaluation. It motivates targeted correction, but supplies no participant evidence or general performance estimate.</p>
          <a href="/research/building-trustworthy-ai/checkmycoach/" class="link-arrow">Evidence record →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="badge badge-gold">Data infrastructure</span></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg mb-2">Knowledge Compiler</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-4">A public software and data artifact containing 2,305 documented exercise-science Knowledge IR nodes and structural checks.</p>
          <a href="/research/building-trustworthy-ai/knowledge-compiler/" class="link-arrow">Artifact details →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="badge badge-gold">Frozen · engineering only</span></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg mb-2">MaxFitCalib-Bench</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-4">A failed execution-contract audit that produced zero interpretable scientific outputs. Retained as an engineering methods record.</p>
          <a href="/research/measuring-ai-reliability/fitcalib-bench/" class="link-arrow">Audit record →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="badge badge-gold">Frozen · simulation only</span></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg mb-2">CalTrust</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)] mb-4">A synthetic LinUCB prototype. Its metrics describe simulated proxies, not human trust or intervention effects.</p>
          <a href="/research/understanding-human-trust/caltrust/" class="link-arrow">Simulation record →</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="card-static mt-8">
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">
          <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Portfolio rule:</strong> software conformance, constructed-corpus outcomes, simulation behavior, and human evidence are reported as different evidence classes. None is used as a substitute for another.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
